messages:
nina: Quick sync marketing wants CTA language locked: prefer "Start free trial" vs "Try now". Also need to confirm sku_id persists through redirects for campaign attribution. Who can validate AWS/GCP/Azure redirect behavior?

victor: FYI AWS auth flow can drop query params on first click if using AWS-auth redirect. Workaround: landing page captures SKU and then redirects with POST -> 302 preserving qs. I've tested before.

emily: Azure note: publisher portal requires explicit redirect_url whitelisting in the offer settings. We'll need the exact redirect URL added before publish. Also confirm privacy_policy_url exists in manifest.

johan: I'll run the publisher preflight and add a lambda to preserve query params. Will post test link when done.

infra-bot: Preflight report: assets.zip uploaded (11.6MB). Detected hero images: hero_aws.png (1200x628), hero_gcp.png (1280x720), hero_azure.png (1024x512). manifest_v1.json present. Warning: azure manifest missing privacy_policy_url field.

legal: Legal check: localized EULA needed for FR/DE/ES plus conversion_notice for EU. If you do NOT collect payment info at trial signup, VAT not required at signup time, but must be included on conversion to paid. Provide billing_consent_text if you plan to capture billing details later.

nina: We will NOT collect billing info on signup. Marketing also needs GA4 utm_campaign and utm_source preserved. Victor/Johan please add a staging test link and run end-to-end through AWS sandbox and GCP test.

victor: Posted test URL: https://staging-pub.redwood.com/onboard/test?sku_id=redwood-standard&utm_source=partner-email . Initial run failed (params dropped). Re-ran with POST-then-302 approach  passed. Leaving notes in the repo.

johan: Lambda snippet I used to preserve query params:
```javascript
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const qs = event.queryStringParameters || {};
  const target = 'https://publisher.checkout/redirect?' + new URLSearchParams(qs).toString();
  return { statusCode: 302, headers: { Location: target } };
};
```

emily: Azure redirect URL added to portal: https://marketplace.azure.com/redirects/redwood-onboard . Please confirm this is the final redirect.

nina: Timeline: assets + manifest + EU EULA drafts by 5pm PT today. Owners: victor => AWS publishing, emily => Azure publishing, johan => infra/publisher handoff. Ping me with blockers. :rocket:
